---
description: Form, validation, and mutation feedback patterns (React Hook Form, Zod, sonner)
alwaysApply: false
---

When building forms, mutations, or field validation, read:

- `docs/constitutions/react-hook-form.md`
- `docs/constitutions/zod.md`
- `docs/constitutions/sonner.md`
- `docs/recipes/validated-form.md` when applicable

- Labels above inputs; validation next to the affected field.
- Prefer React Hook Form + Zod for typed validation boundaries.
- Confirm completed mutations with sonner toasts; do not use toasts for field validation.
- Use Alert Dialog for irreversible destructive confirms.
